# What the image is built from, named rather than everything but a list: a
# file nobody tracks (an agent's worktree, a local note, a scratch database)
# cannot reach the image because nobody thought to exclude it. These are the
# tracked paths the image needs; a new top-level path is added here on purpose.
*
!.editorconfig
!.env.example
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.node-version
!AGENTS.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!composition/
!controller/
!deploy/
!entrypoint.sh
!hq/
!hq_sdk/
!manage.py
!mise.lock
!mise.toml
!policy/
!pyproject.toml
!scripts/
!static/
!templates/
!tests/
!uv.lock

# Inside those, what a checkout builds or caches.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv*/
**/node_modules
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-journal
deploy/bin/
